SCREEN: GIRL PROFILE
Route: `GirlProfile`
Role: profile detail and action hub
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Large hero photo at top.
- Overlay gradient on photo.
- Back button floating over image.
- Small image counter if multiple photos.
- Rich scrollable detail page with multiple sections and sticky footer actions.

Visible content
- Name
- ID line: `ID: {last 8 chars of profile id}`
- Badge row:
  - `Active`
  - `Lv{level}`
  - location
  - language
  - age
- Section: `Self-introduction`
  - bio text
  - `Read more` link if long/default
- Section: `Connections`
  - relationship cards for slot types returned by backend
  - status text like:
    - `You are connected`
    - `Waiting for someone`
    - `In use with {name}`
  - footer text like:
    - `{cost} coins`
    - `Tap to switch`
    - `Tap to manage`
- Section: `Speaking Language`
  - language badges
- Section: `Honor / Charm`
  - `Charm Level: {girl.charmLevel || Rising}`
- Section: `Gifts`
  - inline CTA: `Send Gift`
  - gift grid or empty text:
    - `No gifts yet. Be first one.`
- Sticky footer buttons:
  - `Message`
  - `Gift`
  - `Video Call`

What the page does
- Fetches full girl profile and relationship options.
- Tap `Message` -> `Conversation`
- Tap `Gift` -> gift picker
- Tap `Video Call` -> `OutgoingCall`
- Connection cards open request/switch/break flows via modals.
- Can trigger insufficient-coins modal and coin purchase sheet.

Flow
- Comes from:
  - `HotFeed`
  - `NearbyFeed`
  - `Profile` -> My Connections
  - relationship engine navigation
- Goes to:
  - `Conversation`
  - `OutgoingCall`
  - wallet/coin purchase overlays

Notes
- This is one of the densest screens in the app.
- Several relationship flows live here through modal overlays rather than separate pages.

