SCREEN: CONVERSATION
Route: `Conversation`
Role: 1:1 chat thread
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Dark chat screen with custom top bar.
- Back button, profile thumbnail, name, `Active now`.
- Header action buttons for call, delete, and video call.
- Inverted message list style.
- Rich composer area with support for text, emoji, attachments, gifts, and coin prompts.

Visible content
- Header:
  - girl name
  - status: `Active now`
- Message types shown:
  - plain text
  - photo messages
  - gift messages
  - relationship event cards
- Relationship event card headings:
  - `Bond Ended`
  - `Relationship Update`
- Delete confirmation modal includes:
  - `Delete Conversation?`
- Coin-related prompts can appear through `InsufficientCoinsModal` and `CoinPackSheet`

What the page does
- Loads message history.
- Receives live messages and typing events via socket.
- Sends text messages.
- Supports camera/gallery image send.
- Supports emoji keyboard.
- Supports gifts.
- Supports delete conversation.
- Video-call action -> `OutgoingCall`
- Wallet/coin purchase overlays can appear when user lacks coins for gifts.

Flow
- Comes from:
  - `Inbox`
  - `GirlProfile`
- Goes to:
  - back to previous screen
  - `OutgoingCall`
  - `Wallet` or coin buy overlay paths

Notes
- This is a feature-rich messaging surface, not just a basic thread screen.

