--------------------------------------------------
SCREEN: INCOMING CALL
Route: `IncomingCall`
Role: full-screen incoming video-call prompt
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Full-screen blurred photo background.
- Dark overlay.
- Centered large caller avatar with pulsing ring.
- Two large circular actions at bottom: decline and accept.
- Minimal text labels beneath buttons.

Visible content
- Caller name
- Status text: `Incoming Video Call...`
- Labels:
  - `Decline`
  - `Accept`

What the page does
- Vibrates on incoming call.
- Auto-misses after 30 seconds.
- Accept:
  - hits call accept API
  - if successful -> `VideoCall`
  - if insufficient coins -> coin pack sheet
- Decline -> ends call and closes
- Miss -> ends call and closes

Flow
- Comes from: global trigger/navigation interrupt
- Goes to:
  - `VideoCall`
  - closes back out on decline/miss

--------------------------------------------------
SCREEN: OUTGOING CALL
Route: `OutgoingCall`
Role: calling / connection attempt
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Full-screen blurred background using girl photo.
- Large animated pulsing ring around avatar.
- Single red hang-up button at bottom.
- Minimal cinematic presentation.

Visible content
- Girl name
- Status text changes:
  - `Calling...`
  - `Connecting...`
  - `Need more coins to connect.`
  - `Failed to connect or insufficient coins.`

What the page does
- Simulates ringing delay, then tries to connect.
- On success -> `VideoCall`
- On insufficient coins -> coin pack sheet
- On failure -> temporary error state then back
- Hang up -> back

Flow
- Comes from:
  - `GirlProfile`
  - `Conversation`
- Goes to:
  - `VideoCall`
  - back

--------------------------------------------------
SCREEN: VIDEO CALL
Route: `VideoCall`
Role: active call screen
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Full-screen remote video if available, otherwise blurred placeholder image.
- Small top bar with caller identity and timer.
- Local camera picture-in-picture in top-right if camera permission/device available.
- Bottom floating control row.

Visible content
- Top bar:
  - girl avatar
  - girl name
  - timer `mm:ss`
- Placeholder state:
  - `Connecting...`
  - or `No Video`
- Controls:
  - mute/unmute remote audio
  - mute/unmute mic
  - enable/disable local camera
  - end call
  - gift
- Temporary overlays:
  - live text reaction overlay from incoming auto messages
  - wealth-level toast like `Wealth Level X!`
  - gift burst overlay

What the page does
- Plays remote video loop or placeholder.
- Tracks elapsed time.
- Enforces free-call time cap or paid-call balance cap.
- End call updates backend and profile balance.
- If ending balance is too low, routes user into `Me` tab with top-up nudge.
- Gift flow can trigger insufficient-coins modal and coin sheet.

Flow
- Comes from:
  - `IncomingCall`
  - `OutgoingCall`
- Goes to:
  - back
  - `MainTabs` -> `Me` with post-call top-up hint
  - `Inbox` fallback in some cases

