SCREEN: COIN PACK
Route: `CoinPack`
Role: coin purchase modal sheet
--------------------------------------------------

Current look
- Transparent dark overlay with a large rounded bottom sheet.
- Two-step purchase flow inside one surface.
- Step 1: pack grid
- Step 2: payment gateway picker

Visible content
- Header title: `Make video calls with Coins`
